es</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Load sharing between the shell and centrum in the lumbar vertebral body</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>1997</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>140</fpage><lpage>150</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9122793</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00007632-199701150-00004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grant</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Oxland</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><name><surname>Dvorak</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mapping the structural properties of the lumbosacral vertebral endplates</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>2001</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>889</fpage><lpage>896</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11317111</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00007632-200104150-00012</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Panjabi</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Crisco</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Three-dimensional movements of the whole lumbar spine and lumbosacral joint</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>1989</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>1256</fpage><lpage>1260</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2603060</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00007632-198911000-00020</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rohlmann</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Zander</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergmann</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of the biomechanic